      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-03-17T17:11:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Since it also at the end of your turn you'll draw a card before it activates. So maybe Slip through time was the best you have at the time, so you want to see if you can draw something better to play. It'll allow you to have a chance to draw something and then immediately play that something. All while using two powers this round.</p>",
