      "created_at": "2013-03-18T15:14:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Funny thing, guys. Just played as Omnitronks last night, and I used Slip Through Time&nbsp;<em>twice</em> as ongoing destruction bait (against La Capitan). So yeah, good advice on this. Helped out a lot.</p><p>Didn't help me when I was targeted by both Battle Forged and Captain's orders for most of the game and died really quickly.&nbsp;</p>",
