      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Funny thing, guys. Just played as Omnitronks last night, and I used Slip Through Time&nbsp;<em>twice</em> as ongoing destruction bait (against La Capitan). So yeah, good advice on this. Helped out a lot.</p><p>Didn&#39;t help me when I was targeted by both Battle Forged and Captain&#39;s orders for most of the game and died really quickly.&nbsp;</p>",
