    {
      "id": 55420,
      "name": "broccoli",
      "username": "broccoli",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/broccoli/{size}/1861_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-03-18T16:21:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just one extra use I thought I'd mention....</p><p>When there's good damage buffing out and/or you REALLY need something dead NOW, I use Slip Through Time to pull off both Rocket Punches (they're not limited) in a single round. &nbsp;Without buffing, and ignoring your components, it's still 6 damage in a round, but for each +1 damage, you increase that by 4, so with Inspiring Presnce, Galvanize, and maybe something from the environment, it can get gross pretty quick.</p>",
      "post_number": 10,
